MAGNETICS CONSTRUCTION
Text Notes 26210 26320 0    60   ~ 0
identity per docs/magnetics.md (turns, gap, litz, acceptance lines live there)
Text Notes 26200 26750 0    60   ~ 0
D3 T1-T3: 3x PQ50/50 PC95 stack, 7:7:7 (E8), pri litz 2475x0.071 + sec Cu foil 0.10x28 (E60 Dowell rev), Lm 63uH +/-7% gap-ground
Text Notes 26200 27050 0    60   ~ 0
D2 L1T-L3T: gapped 2x PQ50/50, N=4, bins ~4.0uH, gap ground per bin
Text Notes 26200 27350 0    60   ~ 0
total Lr = trim + measured xfmr leakage (bins COMPENSATE leakage spread); Cr at TANK sections
